And at that hour the Pharisees went out and began to consult with the Herodians about how to kill him. A large crowd was following Jesus.
And Jesus went out with his disciples to the shore of the Sea of Galilee, and a large crowd followed him from Galilee and Judea.
And from Jerusalem and Idumea and from beyond the Jordan, and from the vicinity of Tyre and Sidon, great crowds came to Jesus, having heard of all that he was doing.
And he told his students to prepare a boat for him so that people would not crowd around him, Mark.
Many were healed by him, to the point that all the patients began to crowd around him to be touched by him.
And those possessed by demons, when they saw Jesus, fell at His feet and cried out, saying: “You are the Son of God!”
But Jesus ordered them and strongly urged them not to tell anyone who he was. Jesus chooses the ignorant apostles.
And he went up the mountain and called out to the men he had chosen, and they came to him.
And he chose twelve who he called apostles, to be with him and to send them out to proclaim the good news,
And they have the power to bring out the madness.
And this disregard was from: Simon, whom Jesus named Peter,
And Jacob the son of Zebedee, and his brother John, whom Jesus named Boanerges, which means sons of thunder,
And Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, James son of Alphaeus, Thaddaeus, Simon the Zealot,
And Judas Iscariot, who will betray Jesus. Jesus and Beelzebub.
And after that, Jesus went to a house, and crowds gathered around again so that He and His disciples could not even eat.
And they took Jesus’ family along, and came to get him, saying: “He has lost his mind!”
And the scholars of the law who came from Jerusalem said: “He has Beelzebul, and by the prince of demons he casts out demons.” Matthew
And Jesus cried out to the scribes and spoke to them in parables and said to them: “How can Satan cast out Satan?”
Except for a kingdom divided into factions, and its people are fighting amongst themselves, that kingdom will not be able to remain stable.
Otherwise, a family divided into factions and starting to lie to each other—that family won't be able to stay stable.
C’est une question complexe, mais en résumé, l’intelligence artificielle générative a le potentiel de révolutionner de nombreux secteurs, de la création de contenu à la découverte de médicaments, en passant par l’automatisation des tâches répétitives. Cependant, il est crucial de prendre en compte les défis éthiques et sociétaux qu’elle soulève, notamment en matière de biais, de désinformation et d’impact sur l’emploi. Une approche responsable et encadrée est donc essentielle pour maximiser les bénéfices de cette technologie tout en minimisant ses risques.